   Boppa Llewyn web fonts, self-hosted.

   Geist is the text and UI face, Geist Mono the eyebrow, code, key and version
   face; both are variable, weights 100 to 900, with no italic. The files in
   /public/fonts are the `latin` and `latin-ext` WOFF2 subsets published by
   Google Fonts, split by unicode-range exactly as Google serves them, so a page
   of English text only downloads the `latin` files. Licence:
   /public/fonts/OFL.txt.

   Registered ahead of tokens.css in astro.config.mjs so the @font-face rules
   are parsed before anything asks for the families. The family names are the
   ones tokens.css's --bl-font-sans and --bl-font-mono stacks use.
